{"real": true, "dur": 75.92, "sent": [{"start": 0.2, "end": 7.16, "text": "So here’s the recipe, for anyone teaching a less commonly taught language or an Indigenous language.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 0.2}, {"w": "here’s", "s": 0.46}, {"w": "the", "s": 0.8}, {"w": "recipe,", "s": 0.94}, {"w": "for", "s": 2.1}, {"w": "anyone", "s": 2.48}, {"w": "teaching", "s": 3.08}, {"w": "a", "s": 3.54}, {"w": "less", "s": 3.72}, {"w": "commonly", "s": 4.22}, {"w": "taught", "s": 4.84}, {"w": "language", "s": 5.14}, {"w": "or", "s": 5.62}, {"w": "an", "s": 5.82}, {"w": "Indigenous", "s": 6.1}, {"w": "language.", "s": 6.72}]}, {"start": 7.46, "end": 7.72, "text": "One.", "words": [{"w": "One.", "s": 7.46}]}, {"start": 8.58, "end": 9.7, "text": "Start with your textbook.", "words": [{"w": "Start", "s": 8.58}, {"w": "with", "s": 8.9}, {"w": "your", "s": 9.08}, {"w": "textbook.", "s": 9.24}]}, {"start": 10.52, "end": 15.34, "text": "Identify what learners need to learn, and what they need to be able to do.", "words": [{"w": "Identify", "s": 10.52}, {"w": "what", "s": 11.32}, {"w": "learners", "s": 11.6}, {"w": "need", "s": 12.06}, {"w": "to", "s": 12.28}, {"w": "learn,", "s": 12.46}, {"w": "and", "s": 13.4}, {"w": "what", "s": 13.6}, {"w": "they", "s": 13.84}, {"w": "need", "s": 14.06}, {"w": "to", "s": 14.3}, {"w": "be", "s": 14.42}, {"w": "able", "s": 14.64}, {"w": "to", "s": 14.96}, {"w": "do.", "s": 15.12}]}, {"start": 15.8, "end": 16.079, "text": "Two.", "words": [{"w": "Two.", "s": 15.8}]}, {"start": 16.88, "end": 20.08, "text": "Make a list of exactly what your textbook teaches.", "words": [{"w": "Make", "s": 16.88}, {"w": "a", "s": 17.1}, {"w": "list", "s": 17.18}, {"w": "of", "s": 17.46}, {"w": "exactly", "s": 17.78}, {"w": "what", "s": 18.54}, {"w": "your", "s": 18.82}, {"w": "textbook", "s": 19.04}, {"w": "teaches.", "s": 19.58}]}, {"start": 20.96, "end": 28.7, "text": "Keep teaching and assessment within those limits, while allowing learners to encounter some new language along the way.", "words": [{"w": "Keep", "s": 20.96}, {"w": "teaching", "s": 21.26}, {"w": "and", "s": 21.76}, {"w": "assessment", "s": 21.92}, {"w": "within", "s": 22.88}, {"w": "those", "s": 23.24}, {"w": "limits,", "s": 23.52}, {"w": "while", "s": 24.44}, {"w": "allowing", "s": 24.78}, {"w": "learners", "s": 25.24}, {"w": "to", "s": 25.96}, {"w": "encounter", "s": 26.1}, {"w": "some", "s": 26.76}, {"w": "new", "s": 27.04}, {"w": "language", "s": 27.3}, {"w": "along", "s": 27.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 28.3}, {"w": "way.", "s": 28.46}]}, {"start": 29.36, "end": 29.64, "text": "Three.", "words": [{"w": "Three.", "s": 29.36}]}, {"start": 30.14, "end": 36.54, "text": "Give each linguistic goal its own lesson page, and create a few exercise formats you can reuse.", "words": [{"w": "Give", "s": 30.14}, {"w": "each", "s": 30.46}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 30.74}, {"w": "goal", "s": 31.26}, {"w": "its", "s": 31.88}, {"w": "own", "s": 32.119}, {"w": "lesson", "s": 32.32}, {"w": "page,", "s": 32.68}, {"w": "and", "s": 33.62}, {"w": "create", "s": 33.84}, {"w": "a", "s": 34.22}, {"w": "few", "s": 34.32}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 34.56}, {"w": "formats", "s": 35.06}, {"w": "you", "s": 35.74}, {"w": "can", "s": 35.88}, {"w": "reuse.", "s": 36.06}]}, {"start": 37.08, "end": 37.32, "text": "Four.", "words": [{"w": "Four.", "s": 37.08}]}, {"start": 37.96, "end": 41.32, "text": "Write your own situations where your book doesn’t give you any.", "words": [{"w": "Write", "s": 37.96}, {"w": "your", "s": 38.24}, {"w": "own", "s": 38.44}, {"w": "situations", "s": 38.64}, {"w": "where", "s": 39.7}, {"w": "your", "s": 39.94}, {"w": "book", "s": 40.14}, {"w": "doesn’t", "s": 40.38}, {"w": "give", "s": 40.72}, {"w": "you", "s": 40.9}, {"w": "any.", "s": 41.1}]}, {"start": 41.9, "end": 43.56, "text": "No tool can do that part for you.", "words": [{"w": "No", "s": 41.9}, {"w": "tool", "s": 42.18}, {"w": "can", "s": 42.4}, {"w": "do", "s": 42.64}, {"w": "that", "s": 42.8}, {"w": "part", "s": 42.98}, {"w": "for", "s": 43.22}, {"w": "you.", "s": 43.42}]}, {"start": 44.38, "end": 44.74, "text": "Five.", "words": [{"w": "Five.", "s": 44.38}]}, {"start": 45.24, "end": 47.34, "text": "One exercise, more levels.", "words": [{"w": "One", "s": 45.24}, {"w": "exercise,", "s": 45.46}, {"w": "more", "s": 46.56}, {"w": "levels.", "s": 46.82}]}, {"start": 48.16, "end": 52.54, "text": "If something’s too easy or too hard, add a level and keep the same screen.", "words": [{"w": "If", "s": 48.16}, {"w": "something’s", "s": 48.34}, {"w": "too", "s": 48.78}, {"w": "easy", "s": 49.06}, {"w": "or", "s": 49.52}, {"w": "too", "s": 49.66}, {"w": "hard,", "s": 49.86}, {"w": "add", "s": 50.68}, {"w": "a", "s": 50.94}, {"w": "level", "s": 51.04}, {"w": "and", "s": 51.46}, {"w": "keep", "s": 51.66}, {"w": "the", "s": 51.86}, {"w": "same", "s": 51.98}, {"w": "screen.", "s": 52.24}]}, {"start": 53.5, "end": 53.84, "text": "Six.", "words": [{"w": "Six.", "s": 53.5}]}, {"start": 54.64, "end": 57.68, "text": "Write down your decisions and check the actual screens.", "words": [{"w": "Write", "s": 54.64}, {"w": "down", "s": 54.98}, {"w": "your", "s": 55.28}, {"w": "decisions", "s": 55.42}, {"w": "and", "s": 56.16}, {"w": "check", "s": 56.38}, {"w": "the", "s": 56.64}, {"w": "actual", "s": 56.84}, {"w": "screens.", "s": 57.22}]}, {"start": 58.2, "end": 63.76, "text": "Whether you’re working with AI or with a person, the teacher remains the author.", "words": [{"w": "Whether", "s": 58.2}, {"w": "you’re", "s": 58.5}, {"w": "working", "s": 58.68}, {"w": "with", "s": 59.06}, {"w": "AI", "s": 59.34}, {"w": "or", "s": 60.08}, {"w": "with", "s": 60.24}, {"w": "a", "s": 60.42}, {"w": "person,", "s": 60.56}, {"w": "the", "s": 61.94}, {"w": "teacher", "s": 62.12}, {"w": "remains", "s": 62.58}, {"w": "the", "s": 63.14}, {"w": "author.", "s": 63.36}]}, {"start": 64.68, "end": 69.26, "text": "After all, French and Chinese are very different languages.", "words": [{"w": "After", "s": 64.68}, {"w": "all,", 